    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Build and decorate your garden!</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your garden and turn an old forsaken garden in a forest into a wonderful soothing place for the creatures!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Produce items!</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produces items with the help of residents! Each resident has their own kind of item they can make. Look out for recruiting the ones you need!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Welcome visitors with your locally produced products!</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors come to your garden to relax. Provides your local products to satisfy their needs!</p></li></ul>",
